1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:03,467
♪

2
00:00:03,467 --> 00:00:04,767
( door rattles )

3
00:00:09,557 --> 00:00:10,477
( Kirito sighs )

4
00:00:11,767 --> 00:00:12,687
( grunts )

5
00:00:20,487 --> 00:00:21,817
SYSTEM CALL.

6
00:00:21,817 --> 00:00:23,697
GENERATE LUMINOUS ELEMENT.

7
00:00:27,157 --> 00:00:28,077
( both gasp )

8
00:00:29,577 --> 00:00:32,747
Eugeo: WOW.
LOOK AT ALL THIS STUFF.

9
00:00:32,747 --> 00:00:35,877
Kirito: HURRY. LET’S FIND
OUR SWORDS AND GET OUT OF HERE.

10
00:00:35,877 --> 00:00:37,507
( Eugeo gasps ) THERE THEY ARE!

11
00:00:37,507 --> 00:00:39,927
♪

12
00:00:52,477 --> 00:00:55,267
Kirito: I CAN LEAVE THE ROOM
IF YOU TWO NEED A MINUTE.

13
00:00:55,267 --> 00:00:57,147
( Eugeo laughs ) SORRY.

14
00:00:58,487 --> 00:00:59,487
I DON’T GET IT.

15
00:00:59,487 --> 00:01:01,527
I THOUGHT THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS

16
00:01:01,527 --> 00:01:04,277
WERE ENOUGH
TO STOP THE FORCES OF DARKNESS.

17
00:01:04,277 --> 00:01:05,987
IS THE CHURCH BUILDING AN ARMY?

18
00:01:07,577 --> 00:01:09,077
Kirito: IT’S NOT THAT.

19
00:01:09,077 --> 00:01:10,867
IT’S THE OPPOSITE, IN FACT.

20
00:01:10,867 --> 00:01:13,827
THE CHURCH BROUGHT ALL THIS HERE
TO MAKE SURE NO ONE BUILDS ONE.

21
00:01:13,827 --> 00:01:15,917
Eugeo: WHAT WOULD
BE THE POINT OF THAT?

22
00:01:15,917 --> 00:01:17,707
Kirito: SIMPLE. THE CHURCH

23
00:01:17,707 --> 00:01:20,047
DOESN’T WANT PEOPLE
RISIN’ UP AGAINST IT,

24
00:01:20,047 --> 00:01:22,467
OR, TO BE MORE SPECIFIC,
ADMINISTRATOR DOESN’T.

25
00:01:22,467 --> 00:01:24,007
Eugeo: UM...

26
00:01:24,007 --> 00:01:25,757
Kirito: COME ON.
LET’S GET OUT OF HERE.

27
00:01:25,757 --> 00:01:28,017
TIME’S A-WASTIN’.

28
00:01:28,017 --> 00:01:30,347
Eugeo: YEAH, RIGHT. I’M COMING.

29
00:01:32,767 --> 00:01:35,687
MAYBE WE SHOULD TAKE SOME ARMOR.
WHAT DO YOU THINK?

30
00:01:35,687 --> 00:01:37,817
Kirito: WE NEVER
FOUGHT IN IT BEFORE,

31
00:01:37,817 --> 00:01:39,737
SO IT MIGHT SLOW US DOWN.

32
00:01:39,737 --> 00:01:42,527
IT’S BETTER
IF WE STICK TO WHAT WE KNOW.

33
00:01:42,527 --> 00:01:44,777
WE COULD USE A FRESH SET
OF CLOTHES, THOUGH.

34
00:01:47,487 --> 00:01:48,827
( door creaks )

35
00:01:51,657 --> 00:01:52,707
( Kirito gasps )

36
00:01:52,707 --> 00:01:53,617
( both yell )

37
00:01:55,577 --> 00:01:57,377
♪

38
00:02:08,847 --> 00:02:10,767
( singing in Japanese )

39
00:03:28,427 --> 00:03:30,717
♪ PROUD OF MYSELF ♪

40
00:03:37,887 --> 00:03:39,807
♪

41
00:03:48,817 --> 00:03:50,737
Kirito: BURST ELEMENT!

42
00:03:52,907 --> 00:03:53,827
( Deusolbert grunts )

43
00:03:56,457 --> 00:03:57,367
Kirito: CHARGE HIM!

44
00:03:58,997 --> 00:04:00,577
Deusolbert: FUTILE.

45
00:04:18,437 --> 00:04:20,307
- Eugeo: KIRITO, YOU HIT?!
- ( Kirito groans )

46
00:04:21,897 --> 00:04:25,397
( chuckles ) NO. I’M GOOD.

47
00:04:25,397 --> 00:04:26,897
THAT WAS WAY TOO CLOSE.

48
00:04:26,897 --> 00:04:28,147
( Eugeo sighs )

49
00:04:34,907 --> 00:04:35,947
LET’S GO.

50
00:04:35,947 --> 00:04:37,577
Deusolbert: SYSTEM CALL.

51
00:04:38,707 --> 00:04:40,617
♪

52
00:04:45,747 --> 00:04:47,757
Kirito: UH-OH. NOT GOOD.

53
00:04:47,757 --> 00:04:49,627
THAT’S NO TYPICAL SPELL.

54
00:04:49,627 --> 00:04:51,127
IT’S PERFECT WEAPON CONTROL.

55
00:04:51,127 --> 00:04:53,927
Deusolbert: ENHANCE ARMAMENT.

56
00:05:13,867 --> 00:05:15,197
( Eugeo winces )

57
00:05:15,197 --> 00:05:17,447
Kirito: THAT BOW’S AWESOME!

58
00:05:17,447 --> 00:05:20,157
HOLY HELL.
I WONDER WHAT IT WAS BEFORE.

59
00:05:20,157 --> 00:05:22,037
Eugeo: WE HAVE BIGGER THINGS
TO WORRY ABOUT!

60
00:05:22,037 --> 00:05:25,877
Deusolbert: I LAST BATHED
IN THE CONFLAGRATION BOW’S FIRE

61
00:05:25,877 --> 00:05:27,667
TWO YEARS AGO.

62
00:05:27,667 --> 00:05:32,877
NOW I SUMMON THE FIRE AGAIN
TO DEAL WITH YOU SINNERS.

63
00:05:32,877 --> 00:05:35,717
YOU HAVE THE SKILLS
TO MATCH SIR ELDRIE,

64
00:05:35,717 --> 00:05:38,967
BUT WHAT YOU DID TO HIM
IS UNFORGIVEABLE.

65
00:05:38,967 --> 00:05:41,597
INSTEAD OF FIGHTING
LIKE KNIGHTS WITH HONOR,

66
00:05:41,597 --> 00:05:43,437
YOU CORRUPTED HIS MIND

67
00:05:43,437 --> 00:05:46,227
AND LED HIM ASTRAY
WITH THE DARK ARTS.

68
00:05:46,227 --> 00:05:48,317
Kirito: WHAT?!
IT WAS NOTHING LIKE THAT!

69
00:05:48,317 --> 00:05:51,107
Eugeo: YOU’RE WRONG, SIR KNIGHT!
ALL WE DID WAS REMIND HIM

70
00:05:51,107 --> 00:05:53,067
OF HIS LIFE
BEFORE HE BECAME A KNIGHT!

71
00:05:53,067 --> 00:05:55,817
Deusolbert: WHAT ARE
YOU BABBLING ABOUT?

72
00:05:55,817 --> 00:05:57,947
WE KNIGHTS DO NOT HAVE A PAST.

73
00:05:57,947 --> 00:06:00,907
WE HAVE ALWAYS BEEN
INTEGRITY KNIGHTS.

74
00:06:00,907 --> 00:06:04,667
OUR EXISTENCE BEGINS WHEN WE
ARE SUMMONED FROM THE HEAVENS.

75
00:06:04,667 --> 00:06:06,167
( Eugeo gasps )

76
00:06:06,167 --> 00:06:09,297
Deusolbert: I SHOULD BURN
YOU CRIMINALS TO ASH,

77
00:06:09,297 --> 00:06:12,167
BUT MY ORDERS ARE
TO CAPTURE YOU ALIVE.

78
00:06:12,167 --> 00:06:15,757
UNFORTUNATELY, I HAVE UNLEASHED
THE CONFLAGRATION BOW.

79
00:06:15,757 --> 00:06:19,717
NOW ONE OF YOUR ARMS
WILL MOST LIKELY BE INCINERATED.

80
00:06:26,687 --> 00:06:28,187
( Eugeo gasps )

81
00:06:28,187 --> 00:06:29,897
Kirito: THAT BOW’S
GONNA DO SERIOUS DAMAGE NOW.

82
00:06:29,897 --> 00:06:32,067
Eugeo: ANY IDEAS?

83
00:06:32,067 --> 00:06:35,107
Kirito: I GOT A FEELING
HE CAN’T RAPID-FIRE WITH THAT.

84
00:06:35,107 --> 00:06:38,277
IF I’M LUCKY AND BLOCK
THE FIRST SHOT, YOU CHARGE HIM.

85
00:06:38,277 --> 00:06:40,617
Eugeo: EH,
THAT’S NOT REASSURING.

86
00:06:40,617 --> 00:06:42,327
- ( gasps )
- ( Kirito chuckles )

87
00:06:44,657 --> 00:06:45,327
( Eugeo sighs )

88
00:06:49,787 --> 00:06:50,457
I’M READY.

89
00:07:00,557 --> 00:07:01,637
( winces )

90
00:07:01,637 --> 00:07:03,097
♪

91
00:07:04,597 --> 00:07:05,767
Kirito: SYSTEM CALL!

92
00:07:05,767 --> 00:07:07,807
GENERATE CRYOGENIC ELEMENT!

93
00:07:10,017 --> 00:07:11,477
DISCHARGE!

94
00:07:12,857 --> 00:07:14,067
( woman vocalizing )

95
00:07:14,067 --> 00:07:15,527
Deusolbert: FOOL!

96
00:07:23,657 --> 00:07:24,747
( Kirito gasps )

97
00:07:46,017 --> 00:07:47,687
( yelling )

98
00:07:56,857 --> 00:07:59,197
( winces )

99
00:08:03,987 --> 00:08:06,617
( yells )

100
00:08:09,287 --> 00:08:11,247
- ( groans )
- Eugeo: KIRITO!

101
00:08:11,247 --> 00:08:12,167
( Kirito gasps )

102
00:08:13,667 --> 00:08:15,127
NOW’S YOUR CHANCE! GO GET HIM!

103
00:08:20,047 --> 00:08:21,137
Deusolbert: HMM?

104
00:08:22,717 --> 00:08:24,887
( Eugeo yells )

105
00:08:24,887 --> 00:08:26,137
Deusolbert: DO NOT TOY WITH ME!

106
00:08:31,097 --> 00:08:32,147
Eugeo: NOW WHAT?!

107
00:08:32,147 --> 00:08:33,307
( panting )

108
00:08:33,307 --> 00:08:35,017
Kirito: YOU HAVE TO THINK

109
00:08:35,017 --> 00:08:38,397
ABOUT WHAT YOU’RE PUTTING
BEHIND YOUR STRIKES.

110
00:08:38,397 --> 00:08:41,237
Eugeo: WHAT DO YOU THINK
I SHOULD PUT BEHIND MINE, THEN?

111
00:08:41,237 --> 00:08:42,617
Kirito: THAT’S SOMETHING

112
00:08:42,617 --> 00:08:43,947
YOU’RE GONNA HAVE
TO FIGURE OUT YOURSELF.

113
00:08:43,947 --> 00:08:45,867
♪

114
00:08:55,957 --> 00:08:59,167
Eugeo: THAT’S IT.
SHE’S ALL THAT MATTERS.

115
00:08:59,167 --> 00:09:01,797
I’M HERE FOR HER,
AND NOTHING WILL STOP ME!

116
00:09:03,427 --> 00:09:07,267
BLUE ROSE SWORD,
LEND ME YOUR POWER.

117
00:09:07,267 --> 00:09:11,347
PLEASE, GIVE ME THE STRENGTH
TO KEEP GOING!

118
00:09:11,347 --> 00:09:14,147
( roars )

119
00:09:20,107 --> 00:09:21,317
( Deusolbert grunting )

120
00:09:21,317 --> 00:09:23,657
♪

121
00:09:36,207 --> 00:09:37,997
Eugeo: PLEASE.

122
00:09:37,997 --> 00:09:39,877
YOU’RE COLD AND SHARP,

123
00:09:39,877 --> 00:09:42,927
FORGED SINCE CREATION
BY FREEZING COLD BLIZZARDS

124
00:09:42,927 --> 00:09:44,927
AT THE TOP OF THE END MOUNTAINS.

125
00:09:46,467 --> 00:09:50,177
YOU CAN’T LET
THESE WEAK FLAMES...

126
00:09:50,177 --> 00:09:53,267
MELT YOU NOW!

127
00:10:00,817 --> 00:10:02,647
( yells )

128
00:10:08,907 --> 00:10:11,117
( yells )

129
00:10:13,287 --> 00:10:15,497
( Deusolbert groans )

130
00:10:15,497 --> 00:10:17,537
Eugeo: YOU’RE FINISHED.

131
00:10:20,337 --> 00:10:22,047
( Deusolbert gasping )

132
00:10:22,047 --> 00:10:24,007
( Eugeo yells )

133
00:10:24,007 --> 00:10:26,337
( Deusolbert groans )

134
00:10:32,017 --> 00:10:32,677
( groans )

135
00:10:43,237 --> 00:10:46,947
( sword hums )

136
00:10:48,027 --> 00:10:49,947
♪

137
00:10:54,157 --> 00:10:55,417
( Eugeo gasps )

138
00:10:58,377 --> 00:11:00,297
( Deusolbert gasping )

139
00:11:12,597 --> 00:11:16,267
BOY, THAT FIRST SKILL YOU USED,

140
00:11:16,267 --> 00:11:17,477
WHAT WAS IT?

141
00:11:17,477 --> 00:11:20,017
Eugeo:
IT’S OF THE AINCRAD STYLE,

142
00:11:20,017 --> 00:11:22,357
A TWO HIT STRIKE, VERTICAL ARC.

143
00:11:22,357 --> 00:11:24,777
Deusolbert: A TWO-HIT STRIKE?

144
00:11:26,107 --> 00:11:27,357
AND YOU...

145
00:11:27,357 --> 00:11:29,867
WHAT WAS YOUR SKILL?

146
00:11:29,867 --> 00:11:31,527
Eugeo: KIRITO, ARE YOU OKAY?

147
00:11:31,527 --> 00:11:35,407
Kirito: YEAH, I’M GOOD.
I HEALED THE WORST BURNS MYSELF.

148
00:11:35,407 --> 00:11:38,207
WHAT’S MY SKILL?
IT’S AINCRAD, TOO,

149
00:11:38,207 --> 00:11:39,997
ONE OF THE DEFENSE SKILLS.

150
00:11:39,997 --> 00:11:40,997
IT’S CALLED SPINNING SHIELD.

151
00:11:43,457 --> 00:11:44,547
( Deusolbert sighs )

152
00:11:44,547 --> 00:11:46,587
I THOUGHT I HAD SEEN IT ALL.

153
00:11:46,587 --> 00:11:51,177
I’VE BEEN FROM ONE END
OF THIS REALM TO THE OTHER

154
00:11:51,177 --> 00:11:55,347
AND BEYOND, AND YET THERE
ARE STYLES I’VE NEVER SEEN

155
00:11:55,347 --> 00:11:57,767
AND SKILLS
I’VE NEVER ENCOUNTERED.

156
00:11:57,767 --> 00:12:02,187
I CAN TELL THERE IS
MUCH DISCIPLINE IN YOU

157
00:12:02,187 --> 00:12:05,857
AND YOU HAVE SPENT YEARS
OF TRAINING IN YOUR STYLE.

158
00:12:05,857 --> 00:12:08,107
EARLIER, I ACCUSED YOU

159
00:12:08,107 --> 00:12:11,657
OF USING THE DARK ARTS
TO CORRUPT SIR ELDRIE.

160
00:12:11,657 --> 00:12:15,447
I KNOW NOW THAT I WAS MISTAKEN.

161
00:12:15,447 --> 00:12:17,997
I WOULD BE HONORED
TO KNOW YOUR NAMES.

162
00:12:17,997 --> 00:12:21,207
Eugeo: I AM EUGEO,
THE SWORDSMAN.

163
00:12:21,207 --> 00:12:22,287
Kirito: KIRITO, THE SWORDSMAN.

164
00:12:22,287 --> 00:12:26,377
( Deusolbert sighs )

165
00:12:26,377 --> 00:12:28,257
ON THE 50th FLOOR,

166
00:12:28,257 --> 00:12:31,297
IN THE GREAT HALL
OF GHOSTLY LIGHT,

167
00:12:31,297 --> 00:12:35,217
INTEGRITY KNIGHTS WAIT,
SHOULD YOU PASS ME.

168
00:12:35,217 --> 00:12:38,227
THEY WILL NOT TAKE YOU PRISONER.

169
00:12:38,227 --> 00:12:41,557
THEY HAVE ORDERS TO EXTINGUISH
YOUR LIVES INSTEAD.

170
00:12:41,557 --> 00:12:45,527
IF YOU CHARGE THEM HEAD-ON
LIKE YOU DID ME JUST NOW,

171
00:12:45,527 --> 00:12:48,067
YOU WILL MOST CERTAINLY
MEET YOUR END.

172
00:12:48,067 --> 00:12:50,067
Kirito: WHOA. HANG ON A SEC.

173
00:12:50,067 --> 00:12:52,277
WHY TELL US?
WHOSE SIDE ARE YOU ON?

174
00:12:52,277 --> 00:12:53,827
( Deusolbert sighs )

175
00:12:53,827 --> 00:12:57,447
I FAILED TO CARRY OUT
ADMINISTRATOR’S ORDER.

176
00:12:57,447 --> 00:13:00,537
I SHALL BE STRIPPED
OF MY ARMOR AND DIVINE OBJECT,

177
00:13:00,537 --> 00:13:03,077
THE PROOF OF MY KNIGHTHOOD.

178
00:13:03,077 --> 00:13:06,297
THEN I SHALL BE
FROZEN FOR ETERNITY.

179
00:13:06,297 --> 00:13:10,337
I DO NOT WISH TO SUFFER
THAT INDIGNITY.

180
00:13:10,337 --> 00:13:11,427
THEREFORE...

181
00:13:11,427 --> 00:13:14,257
I WANT YOU TO END MY LIFE.

182
00:13:14,257 --> 00:13:16,097
( both gasp )

183
00:13:16,097 --> 00:13:18,677
Deusolbert:
THERE IS NO NEED TO HESITATE.

184
00:13:18,677 --> 00:13:21,477
AFTER ALL,
YOU DEFEATED ME FAIRLY

185
00:13:21,477 --> 00:13:23,017
USING YOUR SPLENDID SKILLS.

186
00:13:24,357 --> 00:13:25,817
BY THE WAY,

187
00:13:25,817 --> 00:13:29,357
MY NAME IS
DEUSOLBERT SYNTHESIS SEVEN.

188
00:13:29,357 --> 00:13:30,107
( Eugeo gasps )

189
00:13:30,107 --> 00:13:31,527
♪

190
00:13:38,487 --> 00:13:40,997
Eugeo: YOU’RE DEUSOLBERT?

191
00:13:45,457 --> 00:13:47,497
Kirito: EUGEO.

192
00:13:47,497 --> 00:13:50,377
Eugeo: YOU’RE THE ONE
WHO TOOK HER.

193
00:13:59,677 --> 00:14:03,557
A FAIR BATTLE? DIGNITY?

194
00:14:03,557 --> 00:14:06,357
YOU WANT TO DIE WITH HONOR...

195
00:14:06,357 --> 00:14:08,017
DO YOU?

196
00:14:08,017 --> 00:14:10,227
DO YOU?!

197
00:14:10,227 --> 00:14:13,947
WHERE WAS YOUR HONOR WHEN YOU
CHAINED UP AN 11-YEAR-OLD GIRL?!

198
00:14:13,947 --> 00:14:17,077
YOU TIED HER TO YOUR DRAGON
AND TOOK HER AWAY!

199
00:14:17,077 --> 00:14:22,037
DYING WITH HONOR
IS TOO GOOD FOR YOU!

200
00:14:22,037 --> 00:14:22,957
( gasps )

201
00:14:34,377 --> 00:14:35,547
I’M RIGHT.

202
00:14:35,547 --> 00:14:37,677
I AM. AREN’T I?

203
00:14:37,677 --> 00:14:39,677
Kirito: YOU HEARD WHAT HE SAID.

204
00:14:39,677 --> 00:14:41,767
HE’S NOT GONNA FIGHT BACK.

205
00:14:41,767 --> 00:14:44,057
YOU DON’T KILL
A DEFENSELESS PERSON.

206
00:14:46,687 --> 00:14:48,517
Eugeo: I KNOW, BUT...

207
00:14:48,517 --> 00:14:51,107
HE CAME TO MY VILLAGE
AND TOOK ALICE!

208
00:14:51,107 --> 00:14:52,897
♪

209
00:15:02,907 --> 00:15:06,327
Kirito: YOU KNOW THE CHURCH
MESSES WITH THESE GUYS’S HEADS.

210
00:15:06,327 --> 00:15:09,377
I DOUBT HE REMEMBERS BEING
IN RULID OR TAKING ALICE AWAY.

211
00:15:09,377 --> 00:15:11,337
( Eugeo gasps )

212
00:15:11,337 --> 00:15:12,757
Kirito: IT’S TRUE, AIN’T IT?

213
00:15:12,757 --> 00:15:14,967
YOU DON’T REMEMBER.

214
00:15:21,927 --> 00:15:24,477
Deusolbert:
IT IS AS YOUR COMPANION SAYS.

215
00:15:24,477 --> 00:15:26,307
I AM A KNIGHT.

216
00:15:26,307 --> 00:15:27,437
I PROTECT.

217
00:15:27,437 --> 00:15:29,937
I WOULD NEVER KIDNAP A CHILD,

218
00:15:29,937 --> 00:15:32,857
MUCH LESS CHAIN THEM
TO MY DRAGON.

219
00:15:32,857 --> 00:15:35,027
IF I DID, I DO NOT REMEMBER.

220
00:15:35,027 --> 00:15:37,277
Eugeo: WHAT ARE
YOU TALKING ABOUT?

221
00:15:37,277 --> 00:15:39,487
IT HAPPENED EIGHT YEARS AGO!

222
00:15:39,487 --> 00:15:41,327
Kirito: OLD MAN--

223
00:15:41,327 --> 00:15:43,367
I MEAN, DEUSOLBERT.

224
00:15:43,367 --> 00:15:45,327
EIGHT YEARS AGO,

225
00:15:45,327 --> 00:15:48,367
YOU WERE GUARDING
THE BORDER OF NORTH NORLANGARTH.

226
00:15:48,367 --> 00:15:49,577
DO YOU REMEMBER THAT?

227
00:15:49,577 --> 00:15:50,997
Deusolbert: I DO.

228
00:15:50,997 --> 00:15:54,167
DISTRICT SEVEN
IN NORTH NORLANGARTH WAS MINE.

229
00:15:54,167 --> 00:15:57,127
I USED TO PATROL
THE BORDERLANDS.

230
00:15:57,127 --> 00:15:59,547
THAT IS, UNTIL EIGHT YEARS AGO.

231
00:15:59,547 --> 00:16:04,677
FOR SOME REASON,
THE CHURCH REWARDED ME.

232
00:16:04,677 --> 00:16:06,727
I RECEIVED THIS ARMOR

233
00:16:06,727 --> 00:16:10,477
AND WAS GIVEN THE DUTY
TO GUARD THE CENTRAL CATHEDRAL.

234
00:16:10,477 --> 00:16:12,687
Kirito: DO YOU REMEMBER WHAT
THE CHURCH REWARDED YOU FOR?

235
00:16:12,687 --> 00:16:14,897
( Deusolbert sighing )

236
00:16:14,897 --> 00:16:17,197
Kirito: I’LL TELL YOU
WHY YOU DON’T.

237
00:16:17,197 --> 00:16:20,107
YOU WERE ON A MISSION
TO STEAL HIS FRIEND.

238
00:16:20,107 --> 00:16:22,657
SHE’S CALLED
ALICE SYNTHESIS THIRTY NOW.

239
00:16:22,657 --> 00:16:25,037
AS SOON AS YOU
BROUGHT HER BACK HERE,

240
00:16:25,037 --> 00:16:27,287
ADMINISTRATOR REWARDED YOU,
ALL RIGHT.

241
00:16:27,287 --> 00:16:30,457
SHE ALSO ERASED YOUR MEMORY
OF WHAT YOU DID,

242
00:16:30,457 --> 00:16:32,707
’CAUSE SHE CAN’T
HAVE YOU REMEMBERING HER.

243
00:16:32,707 --> 00:16:36,377
YOU TOLD US BEFORE THAT
INTEGRITY KNIGHTS HAVE NO PAST,

244
00:16:36,377 --> 00:16:38,717
YOUR LIVES BEGIN WHEN YOU’RE
SUMMONED FROM HEAVEN,

245
00:16:38,717 --> 00:16:40,547
BUT THAT’S A LIE.

246
00:16:40,547 --> 00:16:43,467
THAT’S SOMETHING THE PONTIFEX
TELLS ALL THE KNIGHTS

247
00:16:43,467 --> 00:16:46,467
RIGHT AFTER THEY COME TO,
AND YOU KNOW WHY?

248
00:16:46,467 --> 00:16:48,597
TO HELP EXPLAIN WHY NONE OF YOU

249
00:16:48,597 --> 00:16:52,807
CAN REMEMBER ANYTHING BEFORE
BECOMING AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT.

250
00:16:52,807 --> 00:16:57,567
SHE DOESN’T WANT YOU TO HAVE
ANY MEMORIES, NOT EVEN ONE,

251
00:16:57,567 --> 00:17:00,697
AND SHE DOESN’T STOP WITH
THE MEMORIES OF YOUR HUMAN LIFE.

252
00:17:00,697 --> 00:17:03,697
SHE TAKES THE ONES YOU HAVE
OF OTHER KNIGHTS, TOO,

253
00:17:03,697 --> 00:17:06,367
THE ONES YOU BROUGHT TO HER
TO GET TURNED.

254
00:17:06,367 --> 00:17:08,247
IF A SINNER
YOU BROUGHT IN FOR JUDGMENT

255
00:17:08,247 --> 00:17:09,997
SHOWED UP AS A KNIGHT
THE NEXT DAY

256
00:17:09,997 --> 00:17:13,747
AND YOU REMEMBERED THEM,
THERE’D BE CHAOS.

257
00:17:13,747 --> 00:17:15,247
Deusolbert:
BUT I WOULD REMEMBER.

258
00:17:15,247 --> 00:17:16,337
I WOULD.

259
00:17:16,337 --> 00:17:17,757
Kirito: LIKE I SAID,

260
00:17:17,757 --> 00:17:20,127
ADMINISTRATOR
STOLE YOUR MEMORIES,

261
00:17:20,127 --> 00:17:23,637
AND THEN SHE FORCED
ABSOLUTE LOYALTY ON YOU.

262
00:17:23,637 --> 00:17:26,507
THEN SHE TURNED YOU
INTO A KNIGHT.

263
00:17:26,507 --> 00:17:28,347
BUT YOU’RE HUMAN, JUST LIKE US.

264
00:17:28,347 --> 00:17:30,557
Deusolbert: HUMAN?

265
00:17:30,557 --> 00:17:33,767
AND HAVING
MY MEMORY MANIPULATED?

266
00:17:33,767 --> 00:17:36,187
BY THE PONTIFEX?

267
00:17:36,187 --> 00:17:38,437
IMPOSSIBLE. ABSURD.

268
00:17:38,437 --> 00:17:40,067
NO, BOY.

269
00:17:40,067 --> 00:17:42,947
YOU ARE THE ONE
WHO IS MISTAKEN HERE.

270
00:17:42,947 --> 00:17:45,317
Kirito: LOOK,
TRY TO REMEMBER SOMETHING,

271
00:17:45,317 --> 00:17:46,947
ANYTHING AT ALL.

272
00:17:46,947 --> 00:17:49,447
I BET THERE’S AN IMAGE
OR A FEELING THERE,

273
00:17:49,447 --> 00:17:52,997
SOMETHING SO PRECIOUS TO YOU,
NO ART CAN ERASE IT.

274
00:17:55,327 --> 00:17:57,667
Deusolbert:
FROM THE TIME I FIRST DESCENDED,

275
00:17:57,667 --> 00:18:00,377
I KEEP HAVING THE SAME DREAM,

276
00:18:00,377 --> 00:18:03,217
A DELICATE HAND
SHAKING ME AWAKE

277
00:18:03,217 --> 00:18:05,467
AND ON ONE FINGER
A SILVER RING.

278
00:18:13,437 --> 00:18:17,187
AND WHEN I DO WAKE UP,
THERE’S NO ONE THERE.

279
00:18:19,727 --> 00:18:21,737
Kirito: WHOEVER
THAT HAND BELONGS TO

280
00:18:21,737 --> 00:18:23,567
IS SOMEONE SPECIAL TO YOU.

281
00:18:23,567 --> 00:18:25,947
ADMINISTRATOR STOLE
YOUR MEMORY OF ’EM.

282
00:18:25,947 --> 00:18:29,577
WHAT YOU DO NEXT IS UP TO YOU.

283
00:18:29,577 --> 00:18:32,907
YOU CAN GO BACK TO ADMINISTRATOR
AND ACCEPT YOUR PUNISHMENT,

284
00:18:32,907 --> 00:18:35,627
OR YOU CAN HEAL YOURSELF
AND COME AFTER US.

285
00:18:35,627 --> 00:18:37,247
YOUR CALL.

286
00:18:40,587 --> 00:18:42,507
♪

287
00:19:05,567 --> 00:19:06,277
( Eugeo sighs )

288
00:19:09,947 --> 00:19:11,737
Kirito: ALL THESE STAIRS,

289
00:19:11,737 --> 00:19:13,787
HOW FAR UP ARE WE NOW?

290
00:19:13,787 --> 00:19:15,997
Eugeo: THE NEXT FLOOR
IS THE 29th.

291
00:19:15,997 --> 00:19:17,577
AT THE RATE WE’RE GOING,

292
00:19:17,577 --> 00:19:19,997
WE’LL REACH THE 50th FLOOR
IN HALF AN HOUR.

293
00:19:19,997 --> 00:19:21,417
SHOULD WE JUST CHARGE IN?

294
00:19:23,757 --> 00:19:24,757
( Kirito sighs )

295
00:19:24,757 --> 00:19:26,507
GOOD QUESTION.

296
00:19:28,587 --> 00:19:29,597
MM?

297
00:19:29,597 --> 00:19:31,717
Eugeo: YOU THINK OF EVERYTHING.

298
00:19:38,227 --> 00:19:40,227
Kirito: AFTER SEEIN’
HOW THAT LAST DUDE FOUGHT,

299
00:19:40,227 --> 00:19:44,027
I GOT A THEORY. COMBO ATTACKS
SEEM TO THROW THESE KNIGHTS OFF.

300
00:19:44,027 --> 00:19:46,777
IT’S LIKE THEY NEVER
HAD TO DEAL WITH ’EM BEFORE.

301
00:19:46,777 --> 00:19:50,067
IF IT’S ONE-ON-ONE
AND WE COULD GET UP CLOSE,

302
00:19:50,067 --> 00:19:51,987
I THINK WE’D HAVE A CHANCE.

303
00:19:51,987 --> 00:19:54,117
BUT THAT KNIGHT SAID
THERE’S A BUNCH UP THERE

304
00:19:54,117 --> 00:19:57,617
AND THEY’RE READY FOR US.
THAT’S GONNA MAKE THINGS HARDER.

305
00:19:57,617 --> 00:19:59,957
Eugeo: YOU’RE RIGHT.
PERHAPS WE SHOULD AVOID THEM,

306
00:19:59,957 --> 00:20:01,247
FIND ANOTHER WAY UP.

307
00:20:01,247 --> 00:20:03,957
Kirito: YEAH,
I DON’T KNOW ABOUT THAT.

308
00:20:03,957 --> 00:20:07,007
CARDINAL SAID THESE STAIRS
WERE THE ONLY WAY UP,

309
00:20:07,007 --> 00:20:09,297
SO WE’RE GONNA
HAVE TO DEAL WITH ’EM.

310
00:20:09,297 --> 00:20:11,507
EVEN IF WE DID FIND
A WAY AROUND,

311
00:20:11,507 --> 00:20:14,217
WE’D HAVE TO FACE ’EM
ON THE WAY BACK DOWN.

312
00:20:14,217 --> 00:20:16,097
WE SHOULD DEAL
WITH THOSE KNIGHTS NOW.

313
00:20:16,097 --> 00:20:18,437
OUR NEW SPECIAL SKILL
SHOULD HELP.

314
00:20:18,437 --> 00:20:21,057
Eugeo: THAT’S RIGHT.
PERFECT WEAPON CONTROL.

315
00:20:21,057 --> 00:20:24,857
Kirito: YUP. MAYBE IF WE
USE IT WHEN WE CHARGE IN,

316
00:20:24,857 --> 00:20:27,737
WE CAN TAKE A BUNCH OUT
BEFORE THEY CAN REACT.

317
00:20:27,737 --> 00:20:30,527
WITH ANY LUCK,
OUR FIRST STRIKE’LL GET ’EM ALL.

318
00:20:30,527 --> 00:20:33,447
Eugeo: ACTUALLY,
WE SHOULD TALK ABOUT THAT.

319
00:20:33,447 --> 00:20:35,787
I DON’T THINK I’LL BE MUCH HELP.

320
00:20:35,787 --> 00:20:37,867
MY VERSION
OF PERFECT WEAPON CONTROL

321
00:20:37,867 --> 00:20:40,787
ISN’T A DIRECT ATTACK LIKE
THAT INTEGRITY KNIGHT’S WAS.

322
00:20:40,787 --> 00:20:42,787
Kirito: WHAT?! Y-YOU’RE KIDDING!

323
00:20:42,787 --> 00:20:44,417
Eugeo: UH-UH.

324
00:20:44,417 --> 00:20:47,337
NOT BASED ON THE COMMAND
CARDINAL WROTE FOR ME.

325
00:20:47,337 --> 00:20:51,177
I MEAN, I GUESS, IN THE END,
IT’S MY FAULT FOR IMAGINING IT.

326
00:20:51,177 --> 00:20:53,137
Kirito: WELL,
LET ME CHECK IT OUT

327
00:20:53,137 --> 00:20:54,097
AND SEE WHAT’S UP WITH IT.

328
00:20:54,097 --> 00:20:55,007
Eugeo: OKAY.

329
00:21:00,597 --> 00:21:01,977
Kirito: YEAH, YOU’RE RIGHT.

330
00:21:01,977 --> 00:21:04,817
IT MIGHT NOT BE QUICK ENOUGH
FOR A SURPRISE ATTACK.

331
00:21:04,817 --> 00:21:08,317
STILL, IT SHOULD COME IN HANDY,
AS LONG AS YOU USE IT RIGHT.

332
00:21:08,317 --> 00:21:09,897
PLUS, IT LOOKS
LIKE IT COMPLEMENTS

333
00:21:09,897 --> 00:21:10,737
MY PERFECT CONTROL ART.

334
00:21:10,737 --> 00:21:12,107
Eugeo: REALLY?

335
00:21:12,107 --> 00:21:13,987
CAN I SEE WHAT YOURS IS LIKE?

336
00:21:13,987 --> 00:21:15,947
Kirito: NAH. I DON’T
WANNA SPOIL THE SURPRISE.

337
00:21:15,947 --> 00:21:17,287
( Eugeo chuckles )

338
00:21:22,077 --> 00:21:23,667
LET’S GET GOING.

339
00:21:23,667 --> 00:21:24,667
HUH?

340
00:21:24,667 --> 00:21:26,337
♪

341
00:21:27,917 --> 00:21:29,757
( girls gasp )

342
00:21:29,757 --> 00:21:31,177
( Eugeo gasps )

343
00:21:34,087 --> 00:21:36,007
( girls sigh )

344
00:21:37,887 --> 00:21:40,347
Kirito: WE SEE YOU. COME OUT.

345
00:21:42,597 --> 00:21:43,727
( girls sigh )

346
00:21:50,027 --> 00:21:51,647
Eugeo: THEY’RE CHILDREN.

347
00:22:05,127 --> 00:22:08,957
Singer: ♪ OH, EVERYTHING
TURNS TO ASH, TO ASH ♪

348
00:22:08,957 --> 00:22:10,877
( singing in Japanese )

349
00:22:18,757 --> 00:22:21,977
♪ AND EVERYTHING
TURNS TO DUST, TO DUST ♪

350
00:22:21,977 --> 00:22:23,887
( singing in Japanese )

351
00:22:31,897 --> 00:22:33,607
♪ FORGET-ME-NOT ♪
